  m_text: 'In this thrilling game, you control a ball by tapping on the screen to
    make it jump and overcome obstacles. Each jump consumes one of your stored balls,
    which are also needed to break through barriers. With each new level, the challenge
    increases: the number of obstacles grows, and you''ll need to score more points
    to progress. Collect diamonds, plan your jumps carefully, and break through the
    barriers! Diamonds can be used to purchase stylish skins for your ball, making
    it stand out on every level. Test your skills and strategic thinking in this
    dynamic game!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be74971f583131744af41fda5a3226cd, type: 2}
